  "releaseNotes": "1.0.1:\n      - Fixed package dependency targeting XrmToolBox for seamless Tool Library distribution and compatibility.\n      - Added official icon asset and metadata for XrmToolBox Plugins Store listing.\n      1.0.0:\n      - Audit solution component overlaps across unmanaged/managed solutions (REC-1).\n      - Trace hierarchical component history across past releases (REC-2).\n      - Publisher filtering and multi-environment support.\n      - Integrated GitHub and Help support via XrmToolBox standard interfaces.\n      - 100% English UI for community distribution in XrmToolBox Tool Library.",
